WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.130
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.400 --> 01:34.930
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.310 --> 01:37.810
[Episode 10]

4
01:39.000 --> 01:40.250
Thank you for your hard work, Comrade Wang Bin.

5
01:39.259 --> 01:41.910
[Temporary Encampment of the Central Column, Jieshou, Xing'an, Guangxi]

6
01:40.700 --> 01:41.580
I'll leave now.

7
01:42.090 --> 01:43.600
[Wang Jiaxiang, Vice-Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission;]

8
01:43.600 --> 01:45.110
[Director of the General Political Department of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

9
01:43.640 --> 01:44.330
Jiaxiang.

10
01:44.610 --> 01:45.500
If the pain is unbearable,

11
01:45.500 --> 01:46.840
[Luofu (Zhang Wentian), Member of the Standing Committee of the Political Bureau of the CPC Central Committee]

12
01:45.800 --> 01:46.920
just cry out.

13
01:46.840 --> 01:48.190
[Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

14
01:48.250 --> 01:49.610
The pain in my wound

15
01:50.530 --> 01:53.530
is nothing compared to the pain in everyone's hearts.

16
01:54.850 --> 01:55.800
Tell me.

17
01:56.560 --> 01:59.560
Ever since Li De came to the Soviet Area,

18
02:00.560 --> 02:04.050
have we fought a single decent battle?

19
02:06.560 --> 02:08.600
Let's not talk about him personally,

20
02:08.600 --> 02:10.530
but the Troika's

21
02:10.580 --> 02:13.980
monopoly on military command.

22
02:15.320 --> 02:17.040
Is there no problem with that?

23
02:18.880 --> 02:20.690
No one else can get a word in.

24
02:22.170 --> 02:23.570
Li De gives blind orders,

25
02:24.690 --> 02:26.440
and Bo Gu blindly nods.

26
02:27.880 --> 02:30.560
Comrade Enlai is the only one doing real work.

27
02:31.410 --> 02:33.480
Relying on him alone,

28
02:34.440 --> 02:36.930
how can this work?

29
02:39.210 --> 02:41.530
We schoolmates from Sun Yat-sen University

30
02:41.530 --> 02:43.650
are powerless at this time.

31
02:44.130 --> 02:44.990
Without fighting,

32
02:44.990 --> 02:47.270
we don't know how important command is.

33
02:48.130 --> 02:49.560
I heard from comrades in the Military Commission

34
02:49.560 --> 02:51.850
that right now, besides jumping up and down and cursing,

35
02:51.850 --> 02:53.450
Li De can't issue any orders.

36
02:53.530 --> 02:54.930
And Bo Gu is even worse...

37
02:55.160 --> 02:55.880
Now,

38
02:56.250 --> 03:00.180
we're relying entirely on the Commander-in-Chief and Comrade Enlai.

39
03:06.560 --> 03:09.810
We can't go on like this!

40
03:10.410 --> 03:11.440
Comrade Zedong.

41
03:11.760 --> 03:14.020
If you have something to say, just say it.

42
03:14.090 --> 03:16.440
Holding it in like this is not the way.

43
03:17.040 --> 03:20.210
Comrade Zedong, as the saying goes,

44
03:20.880 --> 03:23.480
there is no greater sorrow than a dead heart.

45
03:23.930 --> 03:25.650
I know you are very sad.

46
03:26.130 --> 03:29.280
But you absolutely must not be depressed!

47
03:35.450 --> 03:38.480
I may grieve.

48
03:40.280 --> 03:41.930
I grieve for the dead.

49
03:44.480 --> 03:46.010
But my heart will never die.

50
03:47.000 --> 03:48.530
I am examining myself.

51
03:49.000 --> 03:51.130
What are you examining yourself for?

52
03:54.720 --> 03:56.320
Examining my incompetence.

53
03:56.810 --> 03:58.740
Are you the one who's incompetent?

54
03:59.000 --> 04:00.210
Facts have proven

55
04:00.440 --> 04:03.250
that all the suggestions you made were correct.

56
04:03.410 --> 04:05.160
They just wouldn't listen.

57
04:07.720 --> 04:12.550
[Mao Zedong, Chairman of the Central Executive Committee of the Chinese Soviet Republic]

58
04:09.690 --> 04:10.970
But my correctness

59
04:12.250 --> 04:14.210
cannot undo their mistakes.

60
04:15.250 --> 04:18.649
So what is the use of this correctness?

61
04:19.600 --> 04:22.000
I went to them 3 times to offer suggestions,

62
04:22.120 --> 04:23.920
but failed to change their line.

63
04:24.160 --> 04:25.680
This is my problem.

64
04:26.240 --> 04:28.570
No matter how correct my suggestions are,

65
04:28.920 --> 04:33.120
if I can't make them listen, understand, and accept them,

66
04:33.530 --> 04:35.010
that is my fault!

67
04:51.010 --> 04:53.210
With every artillery shell that falls,

68
04:53.720 --> 04:56.600
a swath of our Red Army soldiers falls.

69
04:57.210 --> 04:58.600
Every piece of shrapnel

70
04:59.330 --> 05:01.770
is tearing at the bodies of our soldiers.

71
05:03.120 --> 05:05.650
The water of the Xiang River has turned red.

72
05:06.360 --> 05:07.240
Now,

73
05:07.680 --> 05:09.970
is this the time for us to criticize them?

74
05:10.480 --> 05:11.480
Comrade Zedong.

75
05:11.920 --> 05:16.360
Then what do you say we should do now?

76
05:19.720 --> 05:21.120
There is only one way now:

77
05:21.120 --> 05:22.920
to fight to the death to survive!

78
05:23.650 --> 05:26.530
Our Red Army has always fought to the death to survive.

79
05:26.530 --> 05:28.860
To have a revolution, to achieve victory,

80
05:28.970 --> 05:31.030
we must fight to the death to survive.

81
05:31.160 --> 05:32.159
Chen Changfeng!

82
05:32.800 --> 05:33.210
Here!

83
05:33.409 --> 05:35.770
Write a letter to Commander-in-Chief Zhu.

84
05:35.770 --> 05:36.450
Yes, sir.

85
06:31.320 --> 06:35.250
[Jieshou, Xing'an, Guangxi]

86
06:31.450 --> 06:32.650
Up to now,

87
06:32.770 --> 06:33.920
the main force of the 5th Red Army Corps

88
06:33.920 --> 06:35.720
has just crossed the Guan River from Wenshi Town

89
06:35.250 --> 06:39.180
[Temporary Command Post of the Military Commission]

90
06:35.720 --> 06:36.890
and occupied Wangjiawan.

91
06:36.890 --> 06:37.970
The 8th and 9th Red Army Corps,

92
06:37.970 --> 06:40.010
under the cover of the 34th Division,

93
06:40.010 --> 06:41.800
crossed the Guan River from Shuiche.

94
06:41.800 --> 06:42.600
They have now reached

95
06:42.600 --> 06:45.060
the Qinglong Mountain and Shitangxu areas.

96
06:45.360 --> 06:46.570
Shitangxu...

97
06:47.420 --> 06:48.650
[Zhou Enlai, CCP Politburo Standing Committee Member;]

98
06:48.040 --> 06:50.360
These troops add up to 8 divisions now.

99
06:48.650 --> 06:49.890
[Vice Chair of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission; General Political Commissar of the Red Army]

100
06:50.300 --> 06:51.480
[Li De, Comintern Military Advisor]

101
06:50.409 --> 06:53.159
It will take a considerable amount of time to cross the Xiang River.

102
06:53.159 --> 06:55.010
Currently, the defense line of the 1st Red Army Corps

103
06:55.010 --> 06:57.670
has retreated to the Zhulanpu and Baisha areas.

104
06:57.970 --> 06:58.920
As for the 3rd Corps,

105
06:58.920 --> 07:01.380
[Bo Gu (Qin Bangxian), Head of the CPC Central Committee]

106
06:59.040 --> 07:00.650
its defense line has also been forced to retreat to

107
07:00.650 --> 07:03.530
the second defense line between Guanghuapu and Jieshou.

108
07:03.480 --> 07:06.270
[Zhu De, Chairman of the Central Revolutionary Military Commission; Commander-in-Chief of the Red Army]

109
07:04.360 --> 07:06.970
The situation is very unfavorable for our army.

110
07:06.970 --> 07:08.010
Comrade Li De.

111
07:12.920 --> 07:13.970
Comrade Li De.

112
07:14.720 --> 07:15.920
What is your opinion?

113
07:15.970 --> 07:18.330
I have no opinion.

114
07:18.890 --> 07:20.010
I have no opinion.

115
07:20.210 --> 07:22.040
They wasted the opportunity.

116
07:22.850 --> 07:24.510
They wasted the opportunity.

117
07:27.970 --> 07:28.850
Comrade Li De.

118
07:29.280 --> 07:31.210
I remember Mao said in Wenshi Town,

119
07:31.680 --> 07:33.159
once the battle starts,

120
07:33.480 --> 07:35.810
our tens of thousands of exhausted troops

121
07:35.850 --> 07:38.450
will have to resist simultaneously in all directions

122
07:38.450 --> 07:42.120
the penetration and pincer attacks of hundreds of thousands of enemy troops.

123
07:42.120 --> 07:43.040
For them,

124
07:43.280 --> 07:46.240
this means huge and senseless sacrifices.

125
07:53.240 --> 07:54.100
Comrade Zhu De,

126
07:54.280 --> 07:56.480
let's not mention Mao Zedong right now.

127
07:58.970 --> 07:59.890
Comrade Bo Gu,

128
07:59.970 --> 08:01.040
have you heard the voices

129
08:01.040 --> 08:03.570
of all the commanders and fighters at the front?

130
08:03.570 --> 08:05.920
They are all mentioning Mao Zedong.

131
08:06.480 --> 08:07.280
They all say

132
08:07.800 --> 08:10.530
when Chairman Mao commanded the battles before,

133
08:10.570 --> 08:13.280
the Red Army never fought such a battle.

134
08:15.010 --> 08:16.650
Fine, I admit it.

135
08:16.770 --> 08:18.650
We ignored Comrade Mao Zedong.

136
08:19.450 --> 08:20.850
No, it's me.

137
08:21.040 --> 08:23.410
I was the one who ignored Comrade Mao Zedong's opinions.

138
08:23.410 --> 08:25.430
Now, you keep bringing up

139
08:25.450 --> 08:26.600
Mao Zedong.

140
08:26.770 --> 08:27.480
At this moment,

141
08:27.480 --> 08:29.160
mentioning Mao Zedong is useless.

142
08:29.160 --> 08:30.280
Our top priority now

143
08:30.280 --> 08:32.140
is to do more than just criticize.

144
08:32.280 --> 08:33.760
The battle is not over yet.

145
08:34.289 --> 08:35.650
How should we act?

146
08:36.260 --> 08:38.260
We should order the 1st and 3rd Corps

147
08:38.360 --> 08:40.850
to hold the current defense line at all costs

148
08:41.120 --> 08:43.220
and cover the troops on the east bank crossing the river.

149
08:43.220 --> 08:44.179
Can they hold on?

150
08:44.520 --> 08:46.650
They have to hold on even if they can't.

151
08:46.690 --> 08:48.290
What is needed in a crisis?

152
08:49.120 --> 08:50.050
Determination.

153
08:50.400 --> 08:51.930
There is no other choice.

154
09:12.240 --> 09:12.850
Report!

155
09:13.090 --> 09:13.930
Come in.

156
09:14.250 --> 09:17.310
Please give your instructions, Commander-in-Chief.

157
09:20.050 --> 09:21.600
Execute according to the order.

158
09:21.600 --> 09:22.240
Yes, sir.

159
09:22.450 --> 09:24.170
The 1st Corps telegraphed saying

160
09:24.170 --> 09:26.120
they have no absolute certainty of holding the position.

161
09:26.120 --> 09:27.770
They request the Central Committee to order

162
09:27.770 --> 09:30.050
the troops on the east bank to march day and night.

163
09:30.050 --> 09:31.720
Lin and Nie have never used this tone

164
09:31.720 --> 09:33.400
to send a message to the Military Commission.

165
09:33.400 --> 09:34.090
It seems

166
09:34.400 --> 09:35.690
they are in a perilous situation.

167
09:35.690 --> 09:37.600
The 3rd Corps is under a lot of pressure right now.

168
09:37.600 --> 09:39.520
The Guangxi Army's troops in Xing'an

169
09:39.520 --> 09:41.450
have now increased to 4 regiments,

170
09:41.590 --> 09:44.190
and reinforcements are constantly arriving.

171
09:47.170 --> 09:48.630
I still say the same thing.

172
09:48.850 --> 09:50.000
Let as many break out

173
09:50.240 --> 09:51.720
as possible.

174
09:52.240 --> 09:54.120
If the troops on the east bank can't arrive on time,

175
09:54.120 --> 09:55.600
they'll have let a crucial opportunity slip away.

176
09:55.600 --> 09:57.690
If the troops on the east bank can't arrive on time,

177
09:57.690 --> 09:59.000
they'll have let a crucial opportunity slip away.

178
09:59.000 --> 10:00.240
Nonsense!

179
10:02.640 --> 10:03.930
What do you mean, letting a crucial opportunity slip away?

180
10:03.930 --> 10:06.640
You call that letting a crucial opportunity slip away?

181
10:06.640 --> 10:07.640
Do you know

182
10:08.000 --> 10:09.210
why they

183
10:09.400 --> 10:11.600
couldn't reach the Xiang River on time?

184
11:33.090 --> 11:33.970
Comrades.

185
11:38.570 --> 11:39.600
Comrades.

186
11:40.210 --> 11:41.850
I feel terrible too.

187
11:42.570 --> 11:45.330
My heart feels like it's being cut by a knife.

188
11:45.960 --> 11:47.960
I didn't expect it to be like this.

189
11:49.970 --> 11:53.290
I didn't expect so many people to sacrifice their lives.

190
11:53.290 --> 11:57.290
I couldn't have foreseen it at all.

191
11:59.450 --> 12:01.970
Did you hear me?

192
12:23.820 --> 12:25.660
[Wu Xiuquan, Translator]

193
12:42.390 --> 12:43.170
Comrade Li De.

194
12:43.170 --> 12:44.930
Don't touch me!

195
12:49.860 --> 12:51.140
What's wrong with you?

196
13:06.180 --> 13:07.220
Report!

197
13:08.220 --> 13:09.200
Chen, come.

198
13:09.250 --> 13:10.000
Commander-in-Chief Zhu.

199
13:10.000 --> 13:12.660
Chairman Mao asked me to deliver a letter to you.

200
13:14.930 --> 13:16.150
A letter from Mao Zedong?

201
13:16.150 --> 13:16.830
Yes.

202
13:36.880 --> 13:38.000
What did he write?

203
13:40.360 --> 13:42.970
"Red, orange, yellow, green, blue, indigo, violet."

204
13:42.970 --> 13:45.520
"Who is dancing with a colorful ribbon in the sky?"

205
13:45.520 --> 13:47.720
"After the rain, the setting sun returns."

206
13:47.720 --> 13:49.880
"The verdant mountains rise like ranks of troops."

207
13:49.880 --> 13:52.120
"A fierce battle raged here that year."

208
13:52.330 --> 13:54.090
"Bullet holes pit the village walls."

209
13:54.090 --> 13:55.750
"They adorn these mountains,

210
13:55.810 --> 13:57.870
making them look even better today."

211
13:58.360 --> 14:00.050
This was written by Mao last year.

212
14:00.050 --> 14:02.110
"Bodhisattva Barbarian: Dabaidi."

213
14:02.330 --> 14:03.390
At a time like this,

214
14:03.600 --> 14:04.400
Mao Zedong

215
14:04.520 --> 14:06.720
is still using his poetry to socialize?

216
14:07.090 --> 14:07.820
We don't need

217
14:08.000 --> 14:09.970
his poetry to show off here.

218
14:11.880 --> 14:13.400
Is he mocking us?

219
14:13.520 --> 14:15.050
Is he mocking us?

220
14:15.450 --> 14:16.120
Comrades,

221
14:16.570 --> 14:19.050
being pessimistic, angry,

222
14:19.240 --> 14:20.900
tearful, or disappointed now

223
14:21.190 --> 14:22.260
is useless.

224
14:24.360 --> 14:25.970
Mao's ci poem is telling us

225
14:26.450 --> 14:29.090
that we must be like we were in Dabaidi,

226
14:29.450 --> 14:31.110
fighting to death to survive,

227
14:31.170 --> 14:32.810
so we can turn a tide.

228
14:40.810 --> 14:42.470
Fighting to the death to live.

229
14:44.290 --> 14:46.360
When we came down from Jinggang Mountain,

230
14:46.360 --> 14:47.880
we lost 5 battles in a row.

231
14:48.600 --> 14:50.360
Seeing no way out,

232
14:50.880 --> 14:52.760
Mao proposed

233
14:52.920 --> 14:55.090
that we must fight to the death to survive,

234
14:55.090 --> 14:57.490
and find a way out of a desperate situation.

235
14:57.720 --> 14:58.400
As a result,

236
14:58.690 --> 15:00.000
an ambush in Dabaidi

237
15:00.400 --> 15:02.330
turned the tide for the 4th Red Army,

238
15:02.330 --> 15:05.240
and led to the later Central Soviet Area.

239
15:05.810 --> 15:07.940
What a powerful and brilliant phrase!

240
15:08.690 --> 15:09.360
Enlai,

241
15:09.570 --> 15:11.810
we should send a telegram to the front line,

242
15:11.810 --> 15:13.720
asking the 1st and 3rd Corps

243
15:14.210 --> 15:16.450
to fight with the courage of fighting to the death to survive,

244
15:16.450 --> 15:18.570
and show the heroic spirit of the Red Army.

245
15:18.570 --> 15:19.240
Good.

246
15:21.050 --> 15:22.710
Fight to the death to survive.

247
15:24.000 --> 15:25.210
These words

248
15:26.290 --> 15:28.050
are the only fighting spirit

249
15:28.050 --> 15:29.580
of our Central Red Army now.

250
15:29.970 --> 15:31.640
I suggest this telegram

251
15:32.000 --> 15:34.330
be sent in the name of the CPC Central Bureau, the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

252
15:34.330 --> 15:37.000
and the General Political Department of the Red Army,

253
15:37.000 --> 15:39.880
to ensure that all units of the Workers' and Peasants' Red Army

254
15:39.880 --> 15:42.850
can survive in desperate situations.

255
15:53.600 --> 15:54.600
Agreed.

256
16:04.810 --> 16:05.420
Send it.

257
16:05.520 --> 16:06.170
Yes, sir.

258
16:10.640 --> 16:12.330
Lin, Nie, Peng, and Yang,

259
16:12.970 --> 16:14.170
the December 1 battle

260
16:14.360 --> 16:16.240
concerns the westward advance

261
16:16.600 --> 16:18.000
of our entire field army.

262
16:18.600 --> 16:21.970
Victory will open up prospects for future development.

263
16:20.220 --> 16:22.060
[Deng Ping, Chief of Staff of 3rd Red Army Corps]

264
16:22.160 --> 16:23.680
[Peng Dehuai Commander of the 3rd Red Army Corps]

265
16:22.360 --> 16:26.440
Retreat, and our field army would be cut off by enemy forces one section after another.

266
16:26.440 --> 16:28.700
[Lin Biao, Commander of the 1st Red Army Corps]

267
16:26.880 --> 16:28.820
The commanders of our 1st and 3rd Corps

268
16:28.820 --> 16:30.950
[Nie Rongzhen, Political Commissar of the 1st Red Army Corps]

269
16:28.880 --> 16:30.120
and their political departments

270
16:30.120 --> 16:32.360
should send political workers

271
16:33.000 --> 16:34.810
to each company overnight

272
16:34.850 --> 16:36.710
to conduct combat mobilization.

273
16:37.450 --> 16:39.450
We must rally all commanders and fighters

274
16:37.590 --> 16:39.170
[Zeng Chunjian, Commander of the 18th Regiment, 6th Division, 3rd Red Army Corps]

275
16:39.280 --> 16:40.560
[Wu Zixiong, Chief of Staff of the 18th Regiment, 6th Division, 3rd Red Army Corps]

276
16:39.760 --> 16:42.560
to recognize the significance of today's battle.

277
16:43.050 --> 16:45.690
If we are not victorious,

278
16:45.900 --> 16:47.220
we will be defeated.

279
16:46.720 --> 16:49.440
[Liu Bocheng, Chief of Staff of the 5th Red Army Corps]

280
16:47.240 --> 16:49.910
Victory or defeat concerns the overall situation.

281
16:49.910 --> 16:51.270
Everyone must rouse

282
16:51.290 --> 16:53.360
the highest courage in combat,

283
16:53.600 --> 16:55.290
disregard all sacrifices,

284
16:54.990 --> 16:57.620
[Li Zhuoran, Political Commissar of the 5th Red Army Corps]

285
16:55.720 --> 16:57.360
and overcome fatigue.

286
16:57.850 --> 16:59.450
With a resolute assault,

287
16:59.450 --> 17:02.650
carry out the task of attacking and destroying the enemy.

288
17:03.330 --> 17:05.569
Ensure the complete realization of the Military Commission's

289
17:05.569 --> 17:07.609
combat orders by 1:30 p.m. on 1st.

290
17:08.569 --> 17:11.089
Repelling the enemy from occupied areas,

291
17:11.400 --> 17:13.770
destroying the attacking enemy forces,

292
17:13.800 --> 17:16.160
opening up the road for the westward advance,

293
17:16.160 --> 17:17.530
and ensuring our field army

294
17:17.530 --> 17:19.770
completely breaks through the blockade

295
17:19.770 --> 17:22.680
should be the basic slogans for today's combat.

296
17:23.050 --> 17:25.680
Hope you hold high the banner of victory

297
17:25.810 --> 17:28.050
and head to the front line!

298
17:32.810 --> 17:35.270
December 1, 1934,

299
17:33.180 --> 17:34.570
[Luo Binghui, Commander of the 9th Red Army Corps]

300
17:34.700 --> 17:36.190
[Huang Kaixiang, Political Commissar of the 22nd Division, 9th Red Army Corps]

301
17:36.120 --> 17:37.800
was a crucial day

302
17:37.800 --> 17:39.390
in the Red Army's military history.

303
17:38.360 --> 17:41.290
[Xiao Hua, Political Commissar of the 15th Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

304
17:39.900 --> 17:42.810
The Red Army could no longer afford to suffer further losses.

305
17:41.380 --> 17:43.720
[Peng Shaohui, Commander of the 15th Division, 1st Red Army Corps]

306
17:43.290 --> 17:46.400
Life and death depended on this battle.

307
17:46.810 --> 17:50.090
On the blocking line of more than 10 kilometers in Jiaoshanpu,

308
17:50.090 --> 17:51.910
the 1st Red Army Corps and the Hunan Army

309
17:51.910 --> 17:54.480
engaged in a life-and-death close combat.

310
17:55.330 --> 17:57.120
In the dense pine forest,

311
17:57.120 --> 18:00.120
artillery rumbled and battle cries shook the sky.

312
18:00.360 --> 18:03.290
At Xinxu, Hongshujiao, and Guanghuapu,

313
18:03.290 --> 18:07.090
the 3rd Red Army Corps and the Guangxi Army were fighting desperately.

314
18:06.790 --> 18:08.060
[Luo Ronghuan, Director of the Political Department of the 8th Red Army Corps]

315
18:07.850 --> 18:09.680
The battle started in the early morning

316
18:09.680 --> 18:11.290
and lasted until evening.

317
18:12.600 --> 18:14.360
It wasn't until most of the troops on the east bank

318
18:14.360 --> 18:15.630
crossed the Xiang River

319
18:15.630 --> 18:18.360
that they alternately withdrew from the battle.

320
18:18.650 --> 18:20.000
The 34th Division of the 5th Red Army Corps

321
18:20.000 --> 18:22.160
and the 18th Regiment of the 3rd Red Army Corps' 6th Division,

322
18:22.160 --> 18:24.960
tasked with covering the main force,

323
18:25.140 --> 18:27.740
were cut off on the east bank of the Xiang River.

324
18:27.810 --> 18:30.400
In the end, running out of ammunition and supplies,

325
18:30.400 --> 18:32.600
most of them died heroically.

326
18:33.050 --> 18:35.440
Chen Shuxiang, commander of the 34th Division,

327
18:35.440 --> 18:36.810
led his troops to break out,

328
18:36.810 --> 18:39.880
preparing to return to southern Hunan for guerrilla warfare.

329
18:39.880 --> 18:41.810
He was severely wounded during the breakout,

330
18:41.810 --> 18:42.600
and later,

331
18:42.600 --> 18:45.850
encountered the Kuomintang local security regiment in Dao County

332
18:45.850 --> 18:47.160
and was captured.

333
18:47.400 --> 18:50.730
While being escorted by the enemy, who sought to claim credit and win rewards,

334
18:50.730 --> 18:54.360
he tore his intestines from his abdominal wound

335
18:54.570 --> 18:56.330
and died a heroic death

336
18:56.530 --> 18:58.680
at the age of 29.

337
21:17.220 --> 21:21.240
[Marching Forward on the Bloodstained Path of Our Fallen Heroes]

338
25:07.570 --> 25:08.440
Let's go.

339
25:14.600 --> 25:15.680
The Battle of the Xiang River

340
25:15.680 --> 25:19.140
was the most heroic battle since the Long March of the Red Army.

341
25:19.230 --> 25:20.780
It was a crucial battle concerning the survival

342
25:20.780 --> 25:23.190
of the Central Red Army.

343
25:23.640 --> 25:26.440
In an almost desperate situation, the commanders and fighters of the Red Army

344
25:26.440 --> 25:28.850
fought a bloody battle with the enemy for 5 days and nights.

345
25:28.850 --> 25:30.050
They faced death unflinchingly,

346
25:30.050 --> 25:31.570
fight to the death to survive,

347
25:31.570 --> 25:33.360
and pressed forward with indomitable will.

348
25:33.360 --> 25:34.600
They shattered Chiang Kai-shek's

349
25:34.600 --> 25:38.440
vain attempt to annihilate the Red Army east of the Xiang River.

350
25:39.440 --> 25:41.050
In the Battle of the Xiang River,

351
25:41.050 --> 25:43.400
every inch of land was soaked with the blood of the Red Army,

352
25:43.400 --> 25:46.200
and every step was paved with the bodies of heroes.

353
25:46.600 --> 25:48.080
After crossing the Xiang River,

354
25:48.080 --> 25:49.060
the Central Red Army

355
25:49.060 --> 25:51.530
was sharply reduced from over 86,000 at the time of departure

356
25:51.530 --> 25:53.570
to just over 30,000.

357
25:53.850 --> 25:57.600
To this day, a folk song is still popular in northern Guangxi:

358
25:57.920 --> 26:00.450
Heroes' blood dyed the Xiang River crossing.

359
26:00.880 --> 26:03.610
The riverbed is buried with the bones of martyrs.

360
26:04.120 --> 26:06.600
Do not drink the water of the Xiang River for 3 years.

361
26:05.730 --> 26:18.070
[East Bank of the Xiang River, Guangxi]

362
26:07.200 --> 26:10.350
Do not eat the fish of the Xiang River for 10 years.

363
28:33.810 --> 28:35.670
Comrade Bo Gu, what are you doing?

364
28:37.500 --> 28:39.660
So many comrades have sacrificed.

365
28:41.330 --> 28:43.640
How can I explain this

366
28:44.360 --> 28:46.850
to Comrade Wang Ming?

367
28:47.960 --> 28:48.960
Comrade Bo Gu,

368
28:49.770 --> 28:51.430
this won't solve the problem.

369
28:52.200 --> 28:54.160
As leaders of the Red Army,

370
28:54.600 --> 28:56.400
we have no right to choose death.

371
29:02.130 --> 29:03.000
Let's go.

372
29:04.440 --> 29:06.370
So many comrades have sacrificed.

373
29:06.600 --> 29:08.090
I'm sorry, comrades.

374
29:08.120 --> 29:08.650
Let's go.

375
29:08.770 --> 29:11.490
I'm sorry, comrades.

376
29:16.020 --> 29:23.880
[Guilin, Guangxi]

377
29:16.640 --> 29:18.100
Jiansheng (Bai Chongxi),

378
29:18.290 --> 29:19.890
the battle of the Xiang River

379
29:20.010 --> 29:22.210
not only drove away the Communist army,

380
29:22.330 --> 29:24.260
but also blocked the Central Army.

381
29:24.360 --> 29:26.850
It is truly a blessing for Guangxi.

382
29:27.290 --> 29:28.400
Mr. Li (Li Zongren),

383
29:28.400 --> 29:30.390
this time the Communist army entering Guangxi

384
29:30.390 --> 29:31.550
was a close call

385
29:31.570 --> 29:32.850
for us.

386
29:33.360 --> 29:34.890
But for the Communist army,

387
29:35.120 --> 29:36.580
it was a devastating blow.

388
29:37.050 --> 29:39.570
It seems their command is nothing special.

389
29:41.050 --> 29:45.450
However, after the remnants of the Communist army crossed the Xiang River,

390
29:45.880 --> 29:47.620
they seem to be lingering

391
29:47.640 --> 29:49.330
and resting in our Guangxi territory.

392
29:49.330 --> 29:53.400
I'm worried Chiang Kai-shek will make a big deal out of this,

393
29:53.960 --> 29:56.050
using the excuse of suppressing the Communists

394
29:56.050 --> 29:58.640
to order Xue Yue's troops into Guangxi.

395
29:59.490 --> 30:00.920
We are truly brothers.

396
30:01.200 --> 30:03.160
We share the same concerns.

397
30:04.390 --> 30:05.730
In the battle of the Xiang River,

398
30:05.730 --> 30:07.860
my troops also suffered heavy losses.

399
30:08.050 --> 30:10.600
If the Central Army takes the opportunity

400
30:10.850 --> 30:12.160
to bring troops into Guangxi,

401
30:12.160 --> 30:14.810
we will be at a great military disadvantage.

402
30:15.530 --> 30:18.190
While you were commanding the battle in Guilin,

403
30:18.680 --> 30:21.880
Chiang Kai-shek sent a telegram holding us accountable.

404
30:22.570 --> 30:24.600
I was afraid it would affect your command,

405
30:24.600 --> 30:27.050
so I had it held back.

406
30:28.200 --> 30:29.600
Holding us accountable?

407
30:29.850 --> 30:30.980
Staff Officer Chen.

408
30:31.290 --> 30:31.920
Here.

409
30:34.160 --> 30:35.990
Read the telegram.

410
30:36.080 --> 30:36.640
Yes, sir.

411
30:36.920 --> 30:38.050
Read the key points.

412
30:38.140 --> 30:38.950
Yes, sir.

413
30:41.900 --> 30:44.810
The Communist army is exhausted and on the verge of annihilation.

414
30:44.810 --> 30:48.050
Your unit disobeyed orders by opening up the vital route between Sichuan and Guizhou,

415
30:48.050 --> 30:49.770
which is undoubtedly letting the enemy go free.

416
30:49.770 --> 30:52.290
Our years of effort have fallen short of success.

417
30:52.290 --> 30:54.680
If they manage to rise from the ashes because of this,

418
30:54.680 --> 30:56.470
they will forever be a scourge to the Party.

419
30:56.470 --> 30:58.080
What will the public say?

420
30:58.330 --> 30:59.200
Besides me,

421
30:59.400 --> 31:02.960
who would believe you don't have personal ties with the Communist army?

422
31:02.960 --> 31:03.820
That's enough.

423
31:04.050 --> 31:05.600
This Chiang Kai-shek.

424
31:06.070 --> 31:09.310
The Central Army hesitated in Dao County.

425
31:09.330 --> 31:10.850
He turned a blind eye to it,

426
31:10.880 --> 31:14.370
[Bai Chongxi, Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Guangxi Army]

427
31:11.010 --> 31:12.740
and instead put the blame on us.

428
31:12.870 --> 31:14.510
It's simply outrageous.

429
31:14.620 --> 31:16.120
[Li Zongren, Commander-in-Chief of the Guangxi Army]

430
31:14.770 --> 31:16.050
He did it on purpose.

431
31:16.600 --> 31:18.050
He is pretending to hold us accountable,

432
31:18.050 --> 31:22.440
but actually looking for an excuse to send troops into Guangxi.

433
31:23.440 --> 31:25.090
We almost fell for his trick.

434
31:25.810 --> 31:26.600
Well then.

435
31:26.810 --> 31:29.640
Let's just ignore him,

436
31:30.190 --> 31:31.750
reply politely,

437
31:31.770 --> 31:32.880
and shut him up.

438
31:34.640 --> 31:35.360
No.

439
31:35.810 --> 31:39.160
Chiang has always responded to force, not weakness.

440
31:39.600 --> 31:41.810
If you are polite to him,

441
31:43.290 --> 31:44.530
he will instead think

442
31:45.310 --> 31:46.970
you have a guilty conscience.

443
31:47.290 --> 31:48.810
Mr. Li, you know him best.

444
31:49.640 --> 31:51.730
Here, take this down.

445
31:52.120 --> 31:52.810
Yes, sir.

446
31:54.400 --> 31:55.920
To the Generalissimo:

447
31:56.200 --> 31:59.740
My troops only have 18 or 19 regiments,

448
31:59.770 --> 32:02.090
but the designated defense line

449
32:02.730 --> 32:04.160
stretches over a thousand kilometers,

450
32:04.160 --> 32:07.440
which has truly exceeded our capacity.

451
32:08.090 --> 32:11.020
Sun Tzu said, if you prepare on the left, the right will be weak.

452
32:11.020 --> 32:12.960
If you prepare on the right, the left will be weak.

453
32:12.960 --> 32:14.910
If you prepare in the front, the rear will be weak.

454
32:14.910 --> 32:17.250
If you prepare everywhere, you will be weak everywhere.

455
32:17.250 --> 32:20.090
Your Excellency, you hold a million troops,

456
32:20.530 --> 32:23.850
with your forces concentrated around Xinning and Dong'an.

457
32:23.850 --> 32:25.370
Instead of taking advantage of the Communist army's exhaustion,

458
32:25.370 --> 32:26.920
before they can catch their breath,

459
32:26.920 --> 32:30.090
to encircle and annihilate them in Ningyuan and Dao County in one fell swoop,

460
32:30.090 --> 32:32.600
you hesitate to advance.

461
32:32.880 --> 32:34.290
What is your intention?

462
32:35.290 --> 32:38.090
Are you trying to make Guangxi bear the brunt of it?

463
32:38.360 --> 32:42.510
Although my troops captured only a little over 7,000 men

464
32:42.570 --> 32:44.630
in the battles at Longhu and Yong'an,

465
32:44.880 --> 32:49.250
by comparison, Your Excellency, you have drained the nation's tax revenues and resources,

466
32:49.250 --> 32:50.850
commanded a million troops,

467
32:51.010 --> 32:52.410
and waged war for years.

468
32:52.730 --> 32:55.640
How many enemy troops have you actually annihilated?

469
32:55.640 --> 32:59.750
But this is not to compete with the central government.

470
33:06.360 --> 33:07.810
Li and Bai are insubordinate.

471
33:07.330 --> 33:10.460
[Chiang Kai-shek, Generalissimo of the Military Affairs Commission of the Nationalist Government]

472
33:07.850 --> 33:08.980
This is outrageous.

473
33:09.200 --> 33:09.880
Generalissimo,

474
33:09.880 --> 33:11.200
why not take this opportunity

475
33:11.200 --> 33:12.660
to hold them accountable?

476
33:13.200 --> 33:14.120
Order Zhou...

477
33:15.340 --> 33:16.400
The late Premier once said

478
33:16.400 --> 33:17.960
that I have a bad temper.

479
33:19.730 --> 33:21.760
A lack of patience in small matters will ruin great plans.

480
33:21.760 --> 33:22.700
[Yan Daogang, Director of the Aide-de-Camp Office]

481
33:22.570 --> 33:23.490
Have you ever thought about it?

482
33:22.700 --> 33:23.640
[of the Generalissimo of the Military Affairs Commission of the Nationalist Government]

483
33:24.290 --> 33:27.250
Why do Li and Bai dare to treat me like this?

484
33:25.330 --> 33:27.330
[He Guoguang, Director of the 1st Department, Nanchang Headquarters]

485
33:28.120 --> 33:29.360
Do we really believe

486
33:29.680 --> 33:31.810
that they only have 18 or 19 regiments?

487
33:34.400 --> 33:36.850
We set the tiger on the wolf, yet the wolf still lives.

488
33:36.850 --> 33:38.510
You are wise, Generalissimo.

489
33:39.360 --> 33:40.120
Yuanjing (He Guoguang).

490
33:40.120 --> 33:40.640
Here.

491
33:40.770 --> 33:41.640
Have you finished the

492
33:41.640 --> 33:44.160
"Outline of the Bandit Suppression Plan in the Area West of Xiang River"

493
33:44.160 --> 33:44.730
that I asked you to draw up before?

494
33:44.730 --> 33:46.360
Generalissimo, I have finished it.

495
33:46.360 --> 33:46.880
Good.

496
33:49.770 --> 33:51.730
It is always good to plan ahead.

497
33:52.330 --> 33:53.360
Draft the combat orders.

498
33:53.360 --> 33:54.010
Yes, sir.

499
33:54.490 --> 33:55.850
Organize the Pursuit Army's

500
33:55.850 --> 33:57.880
1st, 4th, and 5th Route Armies into the 1st Army Group,

501
33:57.880 --> 33:59.530
with Liu Jianxu as the Commander-in-Chief.

502
33:59.530 --> 34:01.600
And the 2nd and 3rd Route Armies into the 2nd Army Group,

503
34:01.600 --> 34:03.050
with Xue Yue as the Commander-in-Chief.

504
34:03.050 --> 34:04.190
The above two army groups

505
34:04.190 --> 34:06.380
will advance from the Huangsha River and Quanzhou areas

506
34:05.350 --> 34:07.860
[Yang Yongtai, Secretary of Nanchang Headquarters]

507
34:06.430 --> 34:09.040
towards Xinning, Chengbu, Suining, Jing County,

508
34:09.040 --> 34:10.650
Huitong, and Zhijiang regions respectively,

509
34:10.650 --> 34:13.150
while conducting a parallel pursuit of the Communist army.

510
34:13.150 --> 34:15.280
At the same time, order Wang Jialie's troops of the Guizhou Army

511
34:15.280 --> 34:17.480
to block them along the Jinping and Liping line.

512
34:17.480 --> 34:19.770
Order 2 divisions of the Guangxi Army to pursue from behind.

513
34:19.770 --> 34:22.330
In addition, send 2 divisions to advance to Longsheng

514
34:22.330 --> 34:24.000
to intercept the Communist army.

515
34:24.000 --> 34:25.000
Yes, sir.

516
34:25.510 --> 34:36.120
[East Bank of the Xiang River, Guangxi]

517
34:27.290 --> 34:29.360
Remember, capture them alive!

518
34:30.360 --> 34:31.400
Hurry up.

519
34:32.250 --> 34:33.290
Look over there!

520
34:33.520 --> 34:34.480
Okay, keep up!

521
34:34.850 --> 34:35.810
Over there!

522
34:36.360 --> 34:37.210
Not here!

523
34:37.330 --> 34:38.520
Hurry. Hurry!

524
34:39.810 --> 34:40.940
Capture them alive!

525
34:41.400 --> 34:42.480
Capture them alive!

526
34:42.480 --> 34:44.060
There's movement over there. Right here.

527
34:44.060 --> 34:44.969
Hurry, keep up.

528
34:46.650 --> 34:47.980
Move faster. Over here.

529
34:56.610 --> 34:57.360
Come over here.

530
34:57.360 --> 34:58.080
Go.

531
34:58.080 --> 34:58.610
Hurry up.

532
35:01.210 --> 35:02.210
Over here, hurry.

533
35:02.660 --> 35:04.540
Hurry, over here.

534
35:07.650 --> 35:08.250
Hurry.

535
35:08.560 --> 35:09.960
Any movement over there?

536
35:10.530 --> 35:11.280
Stop!

537
35:11.650 --> 35:12.400
Stop!

538
35:12.560 --> 35:13.810
I see you.

539
35:14.000 --> 35:15.200
Keep moving forward.

540
35:15.770 --> 35:16.520
Hurry.

541
35:30.330 --> 35:31.330
Comrade.

542
35:32.320 --> 35:33.780
Get into the cave quickly.

543
35:36.770 --> 35:37.360
Come on.

544
35:47.600 --> 35:54.410
[Ermu Cave, Bantang Village, Quanzhou, Guangxi]

545
35:59.360 --> 36:00.650
Keep walking inside.

546
36:46.100 --> 36:47.580
A new comrade has arrived.

547
36:50.770 --> 36:51.900
Hello, new comrade.

548
36:52.290 --> 36:53.690
Which Corps are you from?

549
36:53.920 --> 36:59.400
I'm from the propaganda troupe of the 1st Corps' Political Department.

550
37:01.480 --> 37:02.250
I know.

551
37:02.880 --> 37:03.880
I've heard

552
37:05.000 --> 37:06.660
your propaganda troupe sing.

553
37:07.010 --> 37:09.740
H-How old are you?

554
37:10.610 --> 37:11.650
I'm 13.

555
37:11.960 --> 37:14.610
Comrades, finally someone younger than me.

556
37:15.360 --> 37:16.170
Kid.

557
37:16.170 --> 37:18.560
I'm from the 15th Division of the 1st Corps,

558
37:18.560 --> 37:20.890
the former Young Communist International Division.

559
37:20.890 --> 37:22.250
My name is Chen Bolin.

560
37:23.300 --> 37:24.830
I'm one year older than you.

561
37:27.000 --> 37:27.920
Bolin,

562
37:28.130 --> 37:30.290
deal with wetting yourself first

563
37:30.560 --> 37:32.090
before calling others kid.

564
37:36.150 --> 37:41.340
We are all scattered comrades from various Corps.

565
37:41.920 --> 37:43.210
Everyone is injured,

566
37:43.690 --> 37:45.040
hiding in this cave.

567
37:45.610 --> 37:47.540
We formed an independent company.

568
37:47.770 --> 37:50.170
I'm the Company Commander, Peng Guangwen.

569
37:50.520 --> 37:51.730
My name is Cai Zhong.

570
37:52.520 --> 37:55.180
I'm the Instructor and Party Branch Secretary.

571
37:56.400 --> 37:59.290
Kid, what's your name?

572
38:00.130 --> 38:01.480
My name is Xie Xingguo.

573
38:12.730 --> 38:15.880
Welcome, Comrade Xie Xingguo.

574
38:19.640 --> 38:28.170
[Northern Guangxi Mountainous Area]

575
38:43.440 --> 38:44.170
Jiaxiang.

576
38:45.360 --> 38:46.440
I heard that

577
38:47.000 --> 38:49.920
the 2nd Bureau deciphered the enemy's telegram.

578
38:50.440 --> 38:53.170
Chiang Kai-shek has readjusted his deployment.

579
38:53.360 --> 38:55.960
The Hunan Army, Guangxi Army, and Central Army

580
38:56.000 --> 38:57.560
are encircling and intercepting us again.

581
38:57.560 --> 39:00.480
Does the Military Commission have any new deployment?

582
39:00.480 --> 39:02.520
It's the same old story.

583
39:03.170 --> 39:05.250
Li De and Bo Gu still insist

584
39:05.520 --> 39:08.250
on joining forces with the 2nd and 6th Corps in western Hunan.

585
39:08.250 --> 39:09.510
To shake off the enemy,

586
39:09.610 --> 39:11.880
they decided to detour to northern Guangxi,

587
39:11.880 --> 39:13.250
pass through Tongdao in Hunan,

588
39:13.250 --> 39:14.380
and continue north.

589
39:14.520 --> 39:16.650
How long will they remain so stubborn?

590
39:17.290 --> 39:20.350
We've already suffered a great loss at the Xiang River.

591
39:27.210 --> 39:28.430
Where's Comrade Zedong?

592
39:28.430 --> 39:30.470
He hasn't been idle these days.

593
39:30.960 --> 39:34.080
He's busy talking to the various army corps and their cadres.

594
39:34.080 --> 39:36.330
Morale is low, and he's anxious.

595
39:38.130 --> 39:39.170
Comrade Luofu.

596
39:39.810 --> 39:40.960
Have you noticed

597
39:41.130 --> 39:43.480
a big change in Comrade Zedong?

598
39:43.730 --> 39:44.660
What do you mean?

599
39:45.330 --> 39:46.920
In the previous Ningdu Meeting

600
39:46.920 --> 39:48.480
and Southern Jiangxi Meeting,

601
39:48.480 --> 39:50.360
if others didn't listen to his opinions,

602
39:50.360 --> 39:51.490
he would refute them

603
39:51.770 --> 39:53.130
and then stop talking.

604
39:53.440 --> 39:56.480
It always made people feel he was a bit aloof.

605
39:56.730 --> 39:57.730
But this time,

606
39:58.330 --> 40:00.790
he keeps going to the Troika to offer advice,

607
40:01.120 --> 40:02.250
and with you, me,

608
40:02.440 --> 40:04.330
Comrade Enlai, and Comrade Zhu De,

609
40:04.330 --> 40:05.810
he repeatedly discusses things.

610
40:05.810 --> 40:07.540
Now he's going to various corps

611
40:07.770 --> 40:09.440
to talk with the cadres.

612
40:10.000 --> 40:12.250
He is truly persistent.

613
40:12.480 --> 40:15.850
He wants to use a more reasonable way

614
40:16.130 --> 40:18.610
to make more people accept his opinions.

615
40:21.130 --> 40:23.400
Comrade Zedong has some sound ideas,

616
40:23.650 --> 40:25.980
and they deserve a thorough explanation.

617
40:26.040 --> 40:27.850
We can't stay out of it

618
40:27.960 --> 40:29.400
and just be mere critics.

619
40:29.840 --> 40:31.370
We must join Comrade Zedong

620
40:31.480 --> 40:33.130
to find the right path.

621
40:33.520 --> 40:34.220
Okay.

622
40:39.040 --> 40:40.130
Chairman.

623
40:40.330 --> 40:40.990
Chairman.

624
40:42.250 --> 40:43.960
You've been walking for a long time.

625
40:43.960 --> 40:45.730
Why don't you lie down on the stretcher for a while?

626
40:45.730 --> 40:46.770
Don't worry about me.

627
40:46.770 --> 40:48.850
Go ahead and carry the wounded.

628
40:51.640 --> 40:53.950
[Deng Xiaoping, Editor-in-Chief of "Red Star",]

629
40:53.950 --> 40:56.270
[Cadre of the Publicity Department of the Red Army General Political Department]

630
40:56.690 --> 40:57.480
Come on.

631
41:03.730 --> 41:04.520
Let me.

632
41:09.360 --> 41:10.330
Xiaoping.

633
41:11.000 --> 41:13.060
Is the new issue of "Red Star" out yet?

634
41:13.360 --> 41:14.130
We've been on a forced march recently,

635
41:14.130 --> 41:15.130
and time is tight.

636
41:15.480 --> 41:18.100
It's just that after the bloody battle at the Xiang River,

637
41:18.100 --> 41:19.230
morale was low.

638
41:19.550 --> 41:21.210
So soliciting articles is...

639
41:25.770 --> 41:26.830
Comrade Xiaoping,

640
41:26.980 --> 41:29.110
the "Red Star" newspaper is currently

641
41:29.130 --> 41:32.320
the only newspaper of the Party Central Committee and the Central Revolutionary Military Commission.

642
41:32.320 --> 41:34.650
The more difficult the times are for the comrades,

643
41:34.650 --> 41:37.050
the more they need spiritual nourishment.

644
41:37.530 --> 41:39.170
The "Red Star" newspaper should publish more articles

645
41:39.170 --> 41:40.360
to boost morale.

646
41:41.690 --> 41:42.730
Yes, Chairman.

647
41:42.730 --> 41:44.690
I'll go ask them for articles right now.

648
41:44.690 --> 41:46.750
I don't think you need to solicit articles first.

649
41:46.750 --> 41:47.520
The first article

650
41:47.520 --> 41:49.580
can be written by you, Deng Xiaoping.

651
41:51.520 --> 41:52.780
When we were in Ruijin,

652
41:52.920 --> 41:54.250
you were implicated because of me

653
41:54.250 --> 41:55.740
and became one of the so-called "Mao faction" leaders,

654
41:55.740 --> 41:57.170
along with Mao Zetan, Xie Weijun and Gu Bai.

655
41:57.170 --> 41:59.560
You were demoted to Le'an County as an inspector.

656
41:59.560 --> 42:02.170
Later, you went to the "Red Star" as the editor-in-chief.

657
42:02.170 --> 42:04.250
You've made the newspaper lively and engaging.

658
42:04.250 --> 42:05.610
You haven't been disheartened at all.

659
42:05.610 --> 42:07.210
Just write down your thoughts,

660
42:07.210 --> 42:08.690
and it will boost morale.

661
42:09.680 --> 42:11.700
Chairman, I don't have any special thoughts.

662
42:11.700 --> 42:13.610
Just 3 words: follow the Party.

663
42:21.880 --> 42:22.850
Xiaoping.

664
42:23.170 --> 42:24.170
At this moment,

665
42:24.400 --> 42:26.600
these three words, "follow the Party",

666
42:27.330 --> 42:29.790
represent the greatest loyalty to the Party

667
42:30.130 --> 42:31.830
and the highest morale.

668
42:39.650 --> 42:40.470
Keep up!

669
42:47.750 --> 42:48.560
Bo Gu.

670
42:48.880 --> 42:50.810
Comrade Bo Gu, I can walk by myself.

671
42:51.080 --> 42:52.130
Tell them to stop.

672
42:52.290 --> 42:53.290
Stop here.

673
42:54.770 --> 42:56.170
I don't need a stretcher.

674
42:56.770 --> 42:58.170
I don't need a stretcher.

675
42:58.440 --> 42:59.570
Come on, be careful.

676
43:01.250 --> 43:02.210
Be careful.

677
43:02.610 --> 43:03.770
Come on.
